---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="AI Systems & Automation Services | Emon Hossain"
  description="Explore practical AI systems, automation, implementation, and advisory work. Engagement scope and pricing are confirmed only after requirements and delivery constraints are understood."
  ogTitle="AI Systems & Automation Services — Emon Hossain"
>
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">AI SYSTEMS &amp; AUTOMATION</div>
      <h2>Engagements routed through SYSmoAI</h2>
      <p>Start with the business problem, current workflow, constraints, and desired outcome. Scope, delivery plan, and commercial terms are confirmed after qualification.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; gap: 2rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(20rem, 1fr));">
      <div class="service-card highlight">
        <div class="phase">DIAGNOSE</div>
        <h3>AI Systems Diagnostic</h3>
        <div class="desc">A structured review of workflows, bottlenecks, automation opportunities, implementation risks, and expected business value.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Workflow and process review</li>
          <li>Automation opportunity map</li>
          <li>Tool and architecture options</li>
          <li>Prioritized next-step recommendation</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20AI%20systems%20diagnostic." class="cta">Discuss requirements &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">IMPLEMENT</div>
        <h3>Automation / AI Systems Sprint</h3>
        <div class="desc">A scoped implementation engagement for a defined workflow or operating bottleneck, with testing, documentation, and handoff.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Workflow architecture</li>
          <li>AI and API integrations</li>
          <li>Validation and failure handling</li>
          <li>Documentation and handoff</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20automation%20or%20AI%20systems%20implementation." class="cta">Discuss a build &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">OPERATE</div>
        <h3>Managed AI Operations</h3>
        <div class="desc">Ongoing monitoring, maintenance, optimization, and controlled expansion of deployed automation and AI workflows.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Reliability monitoring</li>
          <li>Workflow optimization</li>
          <li>Change management</li>
          <li>New automation capacity</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20managed%20AI%20operations." class="cta">Discuss ongoing support &rarr;</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="phase">ADVISORY</div>
        <h3>Architecture &amp; Strategy Advisory</h3>
        <div class="desc">Decision support for AI architecture, automation economics, tool selection, governance, rollout sequencing, and operating-model design.</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Architecture review</li>
          <li>Build-vs-buy analysis</li>
          <li>Automation economics</li>
          <li>Governance and approval design</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20AI%20architecture%20or%20strategy%20advisory." class="cta">Discuss an advisory need &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; padding: 2rem; background: var(--brand-stone-100); border-radius: 1rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--brand-stone-600);">Commercial terms are not published here until the canonical offer, scope, delivery capacity, and proof requirements are approved.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801711638693?text=Hi%20Emon%2C%20here%27s%20the%20workflow%20or%20business%20problem%20I%27d%20like%20to%20solve%3A" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Discuss a real problem</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
